@1 = ~You behold a shape drawn from the shadows of your own psyche, mortal. I am fashioned from the fears and desires you carry, and from the vestiges of Bhaal's essence that yet stain this place. I am no servant of your dead sire. I am a reflection of what lies within you. Here, in this pocket of your soul, perception bends to will. Even the world's judgment of you may be rewritten. Say what reputation you desire, and I shall make it so.~
@2 = ~Change my reputation.~
@3 = ~No changes for now.~
@4 = ~I remain a reflection of your will, shaped by your mind and Bhaal's fading essence. Would you have the world judge you differently?~
@5 = ~Change my reputation.~
@6 = ~Leave things as they are.~
@7 = ~Choose a reputation range. I can set your reputation to any value from 1 to 20.~
@8 = ~Reputation 1 to 5.~
@9 = ~Reputation 6 to 10.~
@10 = ~Reputation 11 to 15.~
@11 = ~Reputation 16 to 20.~
@12 = ~I have changed my mind.~
@13 = ~Choose the exact reputation you want (1-5). The change is immediate and free.~
@14 = ~Set my reputation to 1.~
@15 = ~Set my reputation to 2.~
@16 = ~Set my reputation to 3.~
@17 = ~Set my reputation to 4.~
@18 = ~Set my reputation to 5.~
@19 = ~Other reputation values.~
@20 = ~Never mind.~
@21 = ~Choose the exact reputation you want (6-10). The change is immediate and free.~
@22 = ~Set my reputation to 6.~
@23 = ~Set my reputation to 7.~
@24 = ~Set my reputation to 8.~
@25 = ~Set my reputation to 9.~
@26 = ~Set my reputation to 10.~
@27 = ~Other reputation values.~
@28 = ~Never mind.~
@29 = ~Choose the exact reputation you want (11-15). The change is immediate and free.~
@30 = ~Set my reputation to 11.~
@31 = ~Set my reputation to 12.~
@32 = ~Set my reputation to 13.~
@33 = ~Set my reputation to 14.~
@34 = ~Set my reputation to 15.~
@35 = ~Other reputation values.~
@36 = ~Never mind.~
@37 = ~Choose the exact reputation you want (16-20). The change is immediate and free.~
@38 = ~Set my reputation to 16.~
@39 = ~Set my reputation to 17.~
@40 = ~Set my reputation to 18.~
@41 = ~Set my reputation to 19.~
@42 = ~Set my reputation to 20.~
@43 = ~Other reputation values.~
@44 = ~Never mind.~
@45 = ~As you wish. The world will know you differently now.~
@46 = ~I want another adjustment.~
@47 = ~That will do. Farewell.~
